":{"sanskritLocator":"6075027","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"442ee08a497e60ca836160651c3823389232a65deb7a1b021298fe6ca33f0f1e","compact":"bf3b014c89202b843d7211e79d7e42c188338777a67667b27680b12afe2e08bf","nasal":"bf3b014c89202b843d7211e79d7e42c188338777a67667b27680b12afe2e08bf"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-75-28","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":75,"verse":28,"english":"And exceedingly dreadful was the encounter that took place between those leonine man and Rākşasa, each eager to conquer the other.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.852,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-88-28"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6075028","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"1d6af3aeca477a2669594c7d09b87c73a71fa37c2d2e296bd36245233af842a4","compact":"81aeee37a565a6e8e009e28b0bb7c9850dd6c6557cc659981ed9f9182d897995","nasal":"81aeee37a565a6e8e009e28b0bb7c9850dd6c6557cc659981ed9f9182d897995"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-75-29","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":75,"verse":29,"english":"Both powerful, and both endowed with strength and possessed of prowess, and both exceedingly invincible; and both having unparalleled might and energy, those heroes faught like two planets in the welkin; or like Bala and Vộtra, irresistible in conflict; and those high-souled ones faught like two lions. And showering countless shafts and displaying many manoeuvres, that foremost of men and that Rāks asas, faught on cheerfully,","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":0.365,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-88-29"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6075029","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"d44d6620459ad82872bf477607ca71d6e305a73ddebbeb91acaedb6dc8309c24","compact":"210f08004c3f2408c055001ab6af7d67dbc667f6e5b1f1b2321c50e6e4363e5a","nasal":"2a75af2ca4